173
00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.030
Taste that one.
Which one, this?

174
00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:38.880
Yeah, this guy.

175
00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.360
I'm gonna keep cutting,

176
00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.423
