193
00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.629
This book is called "Surviving The Apocalypse".

194
00:07:41.629 --> 00:07:44.160
Well, did it come out this year?

195
00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:44.993
No, it did not.

196
00:07:44.993 --> 00:07:48.380
