202
00:08:06.719 --> 00:08:09.810
Thank you very much, if we survive 2020, then...

203
00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:14.380
Thank you so much, which we will, we absolutely will.

204
00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:17.210
So thank you, thank you so much.

205
00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:20.180
And Billy Durney, you are amazing.

206
00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.250
This was such a special experience.

207
00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:26.280
